WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.612
Going on a bear hunt.

2
00:00:04.613 --> 00:00:07.047
I'm not afraid.

3
00:00:07.048 --> 00:00:08.680
It's a river.

4
00:00:08.681 --> 00:00:11.706
It's a wide river.

5
00:00:11.707 --> 00:00:13.599
We can't go over it.

6
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.948
We can't go under it.

7
00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:20.605
Let's swim through it.

8
00:00:20.606 --> 00:00:22.498
Going on a bear hunt.

9
00:00:22.499 --> 00:00:24.207
I'm not afraid.

10
00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:25.660
It's a tree.

11
00:00:25.661 --> 00:00:29.738
It's a tall tree.

12
00:00:29.739 --> 00:00:31.842
We can't go over it.

13
00:00:31.843 --> 00:00:33.906
We can't go under it.

14
00:00:33.907 --> 00:00:39.000
Let's climb up it.

15
00:00:39.001 --> 00:00:41.859
Is there a bear over there?

16
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:43.234
No!

17
00:00:43.235 --> 00:00:45.826
Is there a bear over there?

18
00:00:45.827 --> 00:00:48.940
No!

19
00:00:48.941 --> 00:00:50.903
Going on a bear hunt.

20
00:00:50.904 --> 00:00:52.420
I'm not afraid.

21
00:00:52.421 --> 00:00:57.661
It's grass. It's long grass.

22
00:00:57.662 --> 00:00:59.688
We can't go over it.

23
00:00:59.689 --> 00:01:01.666
We can't go under it.

24
00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:09.029
Let's walk through it.

25
00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:10.834
Going on a bear hunt.

26
00:01:10.835 --> 00:01:12.573
I'm not afraid.

27
00:01:12.574 --> 00:01:14.053
It's a cave.

28
00:01:14.054 --> 00:01:17.818
It's a dark cave.

29
00:01:17.819 --> 00:01:19.854
We can't go over it.

30
00:01:19.855 --> 00:01:21.956
We can't go under it.

31
00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:27.377
Let's creep inside.

32
00:01:27.378 --> 00:01:29.409
Quiet.

33
00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:32.726
Is there a bear in the cave?

34
00:01:32.727 --> 00:01:35.899
YES, there is.

35
00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.247
Run out of the cave.

36
00:01:39.248 --> 00:01:42.225
Walk through the grass.

37
00:01:42.226 --> 00:01:47.856
Climb up the tree and climb down the tree.

38
00:01:47.857 --> 00:01:50.998
Swim through the river.

39
00:01:50.999 --> 00:01:55.357
Go into the house and slam the door.

40
00:01:55.358 --> 00:01:58.628
Jump into bed and pull up the covers.

41
00:01:58.629 --> 00:02:04.740
"WE ARE NEVER GOING ON A BEAR HUNT AGAIN."

